text = "
Damage: Occurs when you collide with walls.
Overheat, the temperature rises:
on the top gauge (Engine):overcharge your drill
on the bottom gauge (Drill): dig or hit a wall
Liquid Bar: You can use this to cool either the engine or the drill. 
Hover over the switch with your mouse and press the A button.
"
